# direnv (https://direnv.net) enters the flake dev shell on cd, and leaves it
# on cd out.  Run `direnv allow` once to enable it.
#
# Install nix-direnv (https://github.com/nix-community/nix-direnv) first: it
# caches the shell and adds it as a GC root, which turns a multi-second
# re-evaluation on every prompt into an instant one.  Without it `use flake`
# works but is slow enough to be annoying.
#
# Not using direnv is fine -- `nix develop` does the same thing explicitly.
use flake
